        "prompt": "Review this session summary: [summary]. Identify stale context, preserve active constraints and errors, then produce a compact continuation brief.",
        "scenario": "Intermediate recovery when agent output begins drifting"
      },
      {
        "title": "Design a Restartable Handoff",
        "prompt": "Create a durable handoff for [workstream]. Record accepted decisions, task status, repository state, verification evidence, approvals, risks, and the next action.",
